Package: vnprox
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: vnprox maintainers <packaging@vnprox.io>
Recommends: lldpd, ifupdown2
Homepage: https://github.com/bgovanlu/vnprox
Description: Visual networking add-on for Proxmox VE
 vnprox is a single-binary add-on installed on every Proxmox VE node that
 provides a visual topology map, safe guided network changes with
 commit-confirm rollback, SDN and firewall editors, IPAM, and LLDP-based
 physical discovery. Proxmox VE remains the source of truth for network
 configuration; vnprox never applies changes outside its change engine.
 .
 See docs/deployment.md in the source repository for install, upgrade, and
 uninstall semantics; docs/security.md for the security model.
